{"topicSections":[{"title":"The bundle","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/init(text:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/verbs","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/actions"],"anchor":"The-bundle"},{"title":"Registering a villain","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/villain(_:key:strength:weapons:prose:onDefeat:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/aggression(of:key:named:strikesFirst:playerStrength:when:prose:)"],"anchor":"Registering-a-villain"},{"title":"Traits the host declares on its items","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weaponStrength"],"anchor":"Traits-the-host-declares-on-its-items"},{"title":"The system’s own voice","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/init()","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/attackFutile","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/noWeapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/notAWeapon","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/weaponNotHeld"],"anchor":"The-systems-own-voice"},{"title":"A villain’s lines","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/init(miss:wound:knockout:death:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/miss","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/wound","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/knockout","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/death"],"anchor":"A-villains-lines"},{"title":"His counter-attack lines","identifiers":["doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/init(miss:wound:playerDeath:)","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/miss","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/wound","doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/playerDeath"],"anchor":"His-counter-attack-lines"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The attack verbs promoted to a mechanic: weapons, villain health, and a villain who answers.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat"]}],"metadata":{"role":"collection","roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"GnustoMeleeCombat","modules":[{"name":"GnustoMeleeCombat"}],"symbolKind":"module","title":"GnustoMeleeCombat"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"Overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The engine ships "},{"code":"attack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" as a stub verb, so every game already knows the word"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and answers it with a sentence. This library takes the word over and puts a body"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"behind it. A swing resolves a weapon, rolls once out of a hundred against a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"per-weapon table, and spends the villain’s health; a knockout puts him on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"floor for 2 turns; the last hit prints his death line, runs the host’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"onDefeat","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" hook, and removes him from play — so the death line is the last thing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"said about him, and has to account for the body. The exchange a player recognizes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from Zork — swing, answer, swing — is written nowhere. It falls out of the turn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pipeline: the player’s blow resolves in the command stages and the villain’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lands with the end-of-turn timers."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the library claims "},{"code":".attack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"code":"MeleeCombat(text:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is where that verb’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"voice lives. "},{"code":"text.stubs.attack","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the line a game without combat"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"prints, and a game with this library never prints it. The four refusals the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mechanics own — swinging at something no villain rule claimed, swinging"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bare-handed, naming a feather as a weapon, naming a sword you aren’t holding —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text"},{"type":"text","text":", passed at init."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It is a "},{"code":"GameContent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" bundle rather than a "},{"code":"GamePlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" because it saves a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ledger: each villain’s health, his stun countdown, whether he is currently in a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fight, and the player’s own wounds, keyed by a string the host chooses. Nothing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"else belongs to it. The villains are the host’s actors, the weapons are the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host’s items carrying the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon"},{"type":"text","text":" trait, and every line"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"either side speaks arrives as "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse"},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse"},{"type":"text","text":", which carry no defaults at all — a library"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"cannot guess a villain’s death sentence."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every roll draws from the game’s seeded stream, so a pinned seed replays a fight"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"blow for blow. The guards are ordered so quiet turns draw nothing: a villain in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"another room, or behind a closed "},{"code":"when:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" gate, or already engaged, burns no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"randomness, which is what keeps one villain’s presence from shifting another"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"villain’s draws. Two simplifications are deliberate and want ledgering per game:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the player’s wounds never heal, and a defeated villain stays defeated."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"Wiring-it-in","text":"Wiring it in","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Mark the weapons, register each villain in "},{"code":"rules","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and splice his"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"counter-attack daemon into "},{"code":"timers","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import Gnusto","import GnustoMeleeCombat","","struct Cavern: Game {","    let melee = MeleeCombat()","","    let sword = Item {","        name(\"elvish sword\")","        trait(.weapon, true)","        trait(.weaponStrength, 3)   \/\/ a keen blade: misses less, kills more","    }","    let troll = Actor { name(\"troll\") }","    let axe = Item { name(\"bloody axe\") }","    @Global var passageClear = false","","    var content: GameContents { melee }","","    var rules: Rules {","        melee.villain(","            troll, key: \"troll\", strength: 2,","            weapons: [sword],","            prose: MeleeCombat.VillainProse(","                miss: [\"The troll swings; the axe bites air.\"],","                wound: [\"Your blow lands, and the troll grunts.\"],","                knockout: \"The troll drops where he stood, out cold.\",","                \/\/ The body dissolves in the line, because the actor is","                \/\/ removed a moment later and nothing else will say so.","                death: \"The troll dies, and his body dissolves.\"),","            onDefeat: {","                passageClear = true          \/\/ unbar the door","                axe.move(to: player.location)  \/\/ and drop the loot","            })","    }","","    var timers: [TimedEvent] {","        melee.aggression(","            of: troll, key: \"troll\", named: \"melee.troll\",","            strikesFirst: 33,","            prose: MeleeCombat.AggressionProse(","                miss: [\"The axe passes within an inch of your ear.\"],","                wound: [\"The axe catches your shoulder.\"],","                playerDeath: \"The troll's axe removes your head.\"))","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The two calls share a "},{"code":"key:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and that is the whole of the connection between"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them. A villain registered with "},{"code":"villain","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" alone never fights back and stays down"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for good once knocked out; one given an "},{"code":"aggression","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" daemon wakes up on his own."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"The-numbers","text":"The numbers","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weaponStrength"},{"type":"text","text":" slides the outcome cutpoints, out of 100."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Strength 2 is the baseline — miss ≤ 30, wound ≤ 70, knockout ≤ 85, kill above —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so a plain "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/Gnusto\/TraitKey\/weapon"},{"type":"text","text":" with no keenness declared fights as it did"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the trait existed. Strength 1 or less is a clumsy blade at 40\/76\/90;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"3 or more is a keen one at 22\/64\/82. When the player names no weapon, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"keenest one he is holding serves."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The counter-attack rolls a flat table: miss ≤ 50, wound ≤ 85, an outright kill"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"above. "},{"code":"playerStrength","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is how many wounds the player survives, default 2."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"strikesFirst","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is the odds out of 100 that a villain starts a fight on a turn"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the player hasn’t — 100 fights on sight, 0 only ever answers a blow, and neither"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of those two values draws from the stream. "},{"code":"when:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is an extra gate checked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before the same-room guard, for a villain whose combat is scoped to one room; it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"does not gate coming round from a knockout, so a man knocked out where his gate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is shut still wakes up."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"anchor":"The-worked-example","text":"The worked example","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Sources\/Zork1\/","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" wires two villains against this library. The troll is the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"straightforward one: he blocks a passage, starts a fight one turn in three, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"his axe is lootable once he falls. The thief is the awkward one, and is why"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"when:","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" exists — he prowls the whole underground picking pockets and fights"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"only in his own lair, so his gate is closed on almost every turn he is alive."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat"},"references":{"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/aggression(of:key:named:strikesFirst:playerStrength:when:prose:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/aggression(of:key:named:strikesfirst:playerstrength:when:prose:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"aggression"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Actor","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto5ActorV"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"key"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"named"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"strikesFirst"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"playerStrength"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"when"},{"kind":"text","text":": () -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"prose"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"MeleeCombat","preciseIdentifier":"s:17GnustoMeleeCombat0bC0V"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"AggressionProse","preciseIdentifier":"s:17GnustoMeleeCombat0bC0V15AggressionProseV"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TimedEvent","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto10TimedEventV"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/aggression(of:key:named:strikesFirst:playerStrength:when:prose:)","title":"aggression(of:key:named:strikesFirst:playerStrength:when:prose:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The villain’s own turn: while he is alive, conscious, in the player’s"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"room, and ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"in a fight","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", each end-of-turn tick rolls once — miss ≤ 50,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wound ≤ 85, an outright kill above. ","type":"text"},{"code":"playerStrength","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" hits end the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"player; wounds don’t heal this phase. A stunned villain spends his turn","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"coming to instead (no roll).","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/actions":{"title":"actions","abstract":[{"text":"The stage-4 default for a target no villain rule claimed.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actions","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"IntentAction","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Gnusto12IntentActionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/actions","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/actions"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/VillainProse/death":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/VillainProse\/death","title":"death","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/villainprose\/death","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Printed when the villain is killed — and the "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"last thing said about","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"him","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"onDefeat"},{"type":"text","text":" runs next, then the actor is removed from play."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"death","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/AggressionProse/miss":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/miss","title":"miss","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/aggressionprose\/miss","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Lines rotated when the villain’s counter-attack misses."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"miss","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/AggressionProse/playerDeath":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse\/playerDeath","title":"playerDeath","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/aggressionprose\/playerdeath","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Handed to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"die(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" when the last hit lands."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"playerDeath","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/AggressionProse":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/AggressionProse","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AggressionProse","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"MeleeCombat.AggressionProse","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/aggressionprose","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A villain’s counter-attack lines."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AggressionProse","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat","title":"GnustoMeleeCombat","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The attack verbs promoted to a mechanic: weapons, villain health, and a villain who answers."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://GnustoMeleeCombat/documentation/GnustoMeleeCombat/MeleeCombat/Text/attackFutile":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/documentation\/GnustoMeleeCombat\/MeleeCombat\/Text\/attackFutile","title":"attackFutile","url":"\/documentation\/gnustomeleecombat\/meleecombat\/text\/attackfutile","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Attacking something no villain rule claimed. Handed the target’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"indefinite","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" name — “a rubber raft”, not “the rubber raft” —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"because a refusal aimed at a whole category of thing is the joke"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"V-ATTACK"},{"type":"text","text":" makes with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"A ,PRSO"},{"type":"text","text":", and a line naming the category"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generalizes where a definite one just repeats t